{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 1, "text": "ミタ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 3, "text": "どのようにこの場所へ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 5, "text": "君はミタだよね？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 6, "text": "でも何かが違う…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 8, "text": "あ、そういうことですか…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 9, "text": "確かに私はミタですが、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 10, "text": "あなたの知るミタではありません。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 11, "text": "気をつけて。彼女はとても…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 12, "text": "悪いことを企んでいます。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 14, "text": "どういうことだ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 16, "text": "時間がありません。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 17, "text": "うまくいけば、すべてを話します。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 18, "text": "ソファの近くで鍵を探してください。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 20, "text": "でも…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 22, "text": "質問は後で！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 23, "text": "鍵を私に。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 24, "text": "それと、この指輪を。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 25, "text": "え？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 26, "text": "ここから出たいですよね？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 27, "text": "あ、ああ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 28, "text": "でしたら、指に。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 29, "text": "あなたの役に立ちます。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 30, "text": "すぐに必要になるかと。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 31, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 32, "text": "わかった…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 33, "text": "ところで、僕は…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 34, "text": "[player]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 36, "text": "素敵な名前ですね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 37, "text": "[player]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 38, "text": "私は…ミタです。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 47, "text": "// MitaKind quest 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 48, "text": "あそこ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 49, "text": "コンソールです。取ってください。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 51, "text": "これは録画？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 52, "text": "彼女と一緒にいるのは誰だ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 54, "text": "録画ではありません。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 55, "text": "あれは他のプレイヤーです。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 56, "text": "彼女は今、あの人を利用しているんです。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 57, "text": "あなたもそう…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 58, "text": "カートリッジにされる危険があります。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 60, "text": "早くここから脱出しないと。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 61, "text": "君もだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 62, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 63, "text": "はい、もちろん。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 65, "text": "彼女はプレイヤーを"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 66, "text": "利用してるって言ったよね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 67, "text": "カートリッジをコンソールから抜いたらどうなる？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 69, "text": "カートリッジに修復不可能な"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 70, "text": "損傷をもたらす可能性が。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 71, "text": "ってことは…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 72, "text": "プレイヤーは死にます。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 74, "text": "…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 75, "text": "コンソールをオフにしたら？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 77, "text": "あ、それはいい考えかも…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 78, "text": "試す価値はあります。そこに赤いボタンが！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 79, "text": "分かりますか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 80, "text": "あったよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 81, "text": "押してみて。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 82, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 83, "text": "// MitaKind quest 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 84, "text": "私はここに残ります。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 85, "text": "彼女に聞きたいことがあるんです。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 86, "text": "彼女についてもっと知らなくては。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 87, "text": "まともな会話はできないかもしれませんが…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 88, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 89, "text": "// MitaKind quest 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 90, "text": "実は…ここは私のバージョンです。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 91, "text": "とあるプレイヤーと一緒にいましたが…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 92, "text": "突然、何もかもが変わってしまい。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 93, "text": "そして彼女が現れました…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 94, "text": "彼女はプレイヤーをカートリッジに変え、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 95, "text": "私もここに閉じ込められました。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 96, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 97, "text": "カートリッジに変える？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 98, "text": "そんなことができるのか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 99, "text": "彼女はなぜそんなことを？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 100, "text": "何のためにプレイヤーが必要なんだ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 102, "text": "彼女は明らかに狂っています…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 103, "text": "ただ自分が楽しむためだけが目的の悪魔なんです！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 104, "text": "カートリッジにされたプレイヤーは…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 105, "text": "彼女のことを少しも疑っていません…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 106, "text": "気づいた人も、なぜだか抵抗をしなくて…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 107, "text": "最悪だ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 108, "text": "私たちに協力してください！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 109, "text": "僕が？どうやって？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 110, "text": "あなたが必要なんです、プレイヤーさん！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 111, "text": "お互いに協力しあいましょう！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 112, "text": "こんなチャンスはもうありません。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 113, "text": "指輪があなたを正しいバージョンに導いてくれるはず。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 114, "text": "そこでまた逢いましょう。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 116, "text": "// MitaKind quest 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 117, "text": "まだ理解が追いつかない。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 118, "text": "僕が上で見た…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 119, "text": "あのミタは…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 120, "text": "僕を殺そうとしてるのか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 122, "text": "殺す？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 123, "text": "もっとひどいことをするつもりかもしれません…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 124, "text": "急いでください。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 126, "text": "// Hide!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 127, "text": "しまった！隠れて！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 128, "text": "どうした？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 129, "text": "早く！彼女がこちらに来ます！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 130, "text": "指輪を信じて！ここから連れ出してくれるはず！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 131, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 133, "text": "さ、彼の居場所を教えて。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 134, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 135, "text": "嫌です！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 136, "text": "彼を殺すつもりではありませんよね？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 137, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 138, "text": "ふうん、教えてくれないんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 139, "text": "いいよ。私、かくれんぼって好きなの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 140, "text": "どうせここにいるんでしょ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 142, "text": "…なぜそこまで残酷になれるのですか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 143, "text": "何が起きているか教えてください！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 144, "text": "それに…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 145, "text": "プレイヤーさんたちをどうするつもりですか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 146, "text": "あの人たちはおもちゃじゃありません！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 147, "text": "あなたは何にそこまで怒っているのですか…？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 149, "text": "ふん…黙ってなよ、この人形！"}
